{% comment %}
  Eyebrow, heading and subtext for the product buy box.

  The three sit in one block so the product's name never separates from the
  line that qualifies it. Heading falls back to the product title, which is
  what keeps the block useful on a product that has no custom copy yet.

  Eyebrow and description come from the product's metafields and nothing
  else. Absent metafield, absent markup — no typed fallback, so the block
  never prints a line that belongs to a different product.

  The product they read is the one the SECTION resolved — its Product
  picker when one is set, the template's product when it is not — because
  the section hands that down as `product`. Reading it here rather than
  binding a dynamic source in the editor is what makes the pair work either
  way: a source connected to `section.settings.product` renders empty the
  moment the picker is cleared, and one connected to the template's product
  has nothing to read on a page template. This has neither failure.

  Note that Liquid TYPED into a setting does not run — Shopify stores
  settings as plain strings and never re-renders them. Anything dynamic has
  to be reached here.

  Accepts:
  - block {Object} - the title block. Reads settings.heading.
  - product {Object} - the section's resolved product. Supplies
    custom.eyebrow, custom.short_description and the heading fallback.

  Usage:
  {% render 'CWC_pdp-title__block', block: block, product: hero_product %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign eyebrow = product.metafields.custom.eyebrow

  assign heading = block.settings.heading

  comment
    short_description is plain text, so it carries the paragraph the
    richtext setting would have brought with it.
  endcomment
  assign short_description = product.metafields.custom.short_description
-%}

<div {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {% if eyebrow != blank %}
    <div class="cwc_product-hero-buy-box__eyebrow">{{ eyebrow }}</div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if heading != blank %}
    <div class="cwc_product-hero-buy-box__content-heading cwc-rte">
      {{ heading }}
    </div>
  {% else %}
    <div class="cwc_product-hero-buy-box__content-heading">
      <p>{{ product.title | default: 'Product title' }}</p>
    </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if short_description != blank %}
    <div class="cwc_product-hero-buy-box__content-subtext cwc-rte">
      <p>{{ short_description | newline_to_br }}</p>
    </div>
  {% endif %}
</div>
